Send: one shared_content message per picked chat (≤ 5, DMs and groups, the forward sheet's list), content_data {kind,id} only + optional caption (≤ 1000), client_message_id per send; a failed target stays selected with its name in the error; share_not_allowed (sender can't see the item) stops with one message.
Card (MessageBubble, shared_content): GET /api/v1/chat/shared-preview as the viewer → skeleton; card (image, kind, title, description; tap opens the in-app url only); unavailable (deleted / not visible to you) with an explanation; load error with Retry. Caption under the card. Malformed content_data falls back to text.
Entry points: community post (profile_posts posts only, not media uploads), event (visitor button + creator menu, signed in), product quick view (drawer body, also used by the Spotlight quick view) and product page (phone / flag-off layout), profile share sheet (by user id).
